# (1.3 step 5, and the user's "more Celtic", 2026-11-10) PERFORM's map has a triskele in its spare cell, turning with
# the music and still when the music stops; the rule over the knobs is a plait; a page's name is in the uncial hand
wait 2000
shot home.png
tap ARP
wait 150
shot page-card.png
wait 2500
shot page.png
tap HOME
wait 200
tap SEL
wait 600
expect view 17
expect ptrisk 1
shot map.png
wait 1700
expect ptrisk 1
shot map-later.png
# an effect held and let go: the map comes back whole, the triskele with it
key w4 down
wait 300
expect pflash 1
key w4 up
wait 400
expect pflash 0
expect ptrisk 1
# a knob turning: its help in the plait's place, the map untouched
turn K4 3 100
wait 100
shot map-turn.png
turn K4 -3 100
# stopped: it stands
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect playing 0
expect ptrisk 1
shot map-stopped.png
